---

<Layout title="Writing">
  <style>
    .page-header {
      padding: 5rem 2.5rem 3rem;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 3rem;
      align-items: end;
    }

    .page-title {
      font-family: 'DM Serif Display', serif;
      font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 4vw, 4rem);
      line-height: 1.05;
    }

    .page-title em {
      font-style: italic;
      color: var(--accent);
    }

    .page-intro {
      font-size: 0.82rem;
      line-height: 1.9;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-family: 'Noto Serif KR', serif;
      border-left: 2px solid var(--border);
      padding-left: 1.5rem;
    }

    .writing-list {
      padding: 3rem 2.5rem;
    }

    .writing-item {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 120px 1fr auto;
      gap: 2rem;
      padding: 2.5rem 0;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
      align-items: start;
      transition: padding-left 0.15s;
    }

    .writing-item:hover {
      padding-left: 0.5rem;
    }

    .writing-meta {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 0.4rem;
    }

    .writing-date {
      font-size: 0.7rem;
      color: var(--accent);
      letter-spacing: 0.06em;
      font-family: 'DM Mono', monospace;
    }

    .writing-type {
      font-size: 0.62rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.1em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--muted);
    }

    .writing-body h2 {
      font-family: 'DM Serif Display', serif;
      font-size: 1.4rem;
      line-height: 1.2;
      margin-bottom: 0.3rem;
    }

    .writing-body h2 a {
      transition: color 0.2s;
    }

    .writing-body h2 a:hover {
      color: var(--accent);
    }

    .writing-en {
      font-size: 0.72rem;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-family: 'DM Mono', monospace;
      margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    }

    .writing-desc {
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      line-height: 1.75;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-family: 'Noto Serif KR', serif;
      max-width: 600px;
    }

    .writing-tags {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 0.4rem;
      margin-top: 1rem;
    }

    .writing-status {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: flex-end;
      gap: 0.5rem;
      padding-top: 0.25rem;
    }

    .status-badge {
      font-size: 0.62rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.08em;
      padding: 0.25rem 0.6rem;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      color: var(--muted);
    }

    .status-badge.done {
      border-color: var(--accent-dim);
      color: var(--accent);
    }

    .chapters-badge {
      font-family: 'DM Mono', monospace;
      font-size: 0.65rem;
      color: var(--muted);
    }

    @media (max-width: 768px) {
      .page-header { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .writing-item { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 0.75rem; }
      .writing-status { align-items: flex-start; }
    }
  </style>

  <header class="page-header">
    <h1 class="page-title">
      Writing &<br/>
      <em>Ideas</em>
    </h1>
    <p class="page-intro">
      교육 기술, AI 전환, ODA 프로젝트 현장에서 쓴 글들.<br/>
      책, 에세이, 발표문, 정책 제언까지.
    </p>
  </header>

  <div class="writing-list">
    {writings.map((w) => (
      <article class="writing-item">
        <div class="writing-meta">
          <span class="writing-date">{w.date}</span>
          <span class="writing-type">{w.type}</span>
        </div>

        <div class="writing-body">
          <h2><a href={w.href}>{w.title}</a></h2>
          <p class="writing-en">{w.titleEn}</p>
          <p class="writing-desc">{w.desc}</p>
          <div class="writing-tags">
            {w.tags.map(tag => <span class="tag">{tag}</span>)}
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="writing-status">
          <span class={`status-badge ${w.status === '완료' ? 'done' : ''}`}>{w.status}</span>
          {w.chapters && <span class="chapters-badge">{w.chapters} chapters</span>}
        </div>
      </article>
    ))}
  </div>
</Layout>
